# <capture name> | what the user must see
neutrals_camp | A camp of 3 GREY Spearmen (neutral, not a player's colour) at the map centre, and my 6 Men-at-arms in blue 40 m to the left, nobody fighting yet
neutrals_fight | The camp has charged: the grey Spearmen run at my blue Men-at-arms or are already in melee with them (blows, health bars); a tree may hide part of the scene
neutrals_cleared | The fight is over: the 3 grey Spearmen are dead (no grey unit standing at the centre), my blue Men-at-arms stand
